  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers OpenID Connect Client-Initiated Backchannel Authentication (CIBA) Core 1.0, Final of 1 September 2021, as the current line: discovery and registration metadata, the backchannel authentication request and signed request objects, user codes, the auth_req_id acknowledgement, poll, ping and push delivery, the CIBA grant, errors, and push-mode ID Token bindings. Implementer's Drafts 1 and 2 and the 2017 MODRNA draft are legacy lines with upgrade paths, and the CIBA Core 1.0 errata set 1 draft (draft 06, 23 January 2025) is tracked as a preview. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, the backchannel request, delivery modes, and security with a FAPI-CIBA summary.",
